@anon.faf009aaacdb3bbda30f9435f6d39aa4.1404 = private unnamed_addr constant [566 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for uses of Airflow functions and values that have been moved to it providers.\0A(e.g., apache-airflow-providers-fab)\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AAirflow 3.0 moved various deprecated functions, members, and other\0Avalues to its providers. The user needs to install the corresponding provider and replace\0Athe original usage with the one in the provider\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0Afrom airflow.auth.managers.fab.fab_auth_manage import FabAuthManager\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0Afrom airflow.providers.fab.auth_manager.fab_auth_manage import FabAuthManager\0A```\0A", align 1
