@anon.faf009aaacdb3bbda30f9435f6d39aa4.1831 = private unnamed_addr constant [435 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for uses of the `xml.etree.cElementTree` module.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AIn Python 3.3, `xml.etree.cElementTree` was deprecated in favor of\0A`xml.etree.ElementTree`.\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0Afrom xml.etree import cElementTree\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0Afrom xml.etree import ElementTree\0A```\0A\0A## References\0A- [Python documentation: `xml.etree.ElementTree`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/xml.etree.elementtree.html)\0A", align 1
